The cost of a self‑sufficient worldship does not scale linearly with mass. Using a power‑law model C \propto M^\gamma with \gamma \in [1.3, 1.8], the total programme cost lies in the range 1.8 \times 10^{13} to 5.0 \times 10^{14} USD (2026 dollars).

